# The icon subset is source, not a stray note: the self-hosted Material Symbols
# face is generated from it and a test reads it. The blanket *.txt above
# swallowed it silently — `git add -A` committed the fonts beside it and said
# nothing — so the build failed only on CI, where the file did not exist.
